{"id":"inoj","lemma":"иной","pos":"det","rank":2749,"glosses":["other, another, different","some, many a"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9a/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"neuter":"иное","feminine":"иная","plural":"иные"},"examples":[{"text":"Это не что иное, как чудо.","en":"It's nothing short of a miracle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1098791","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"what / that"},null,{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"miracle, marvel"}]},{"text":"Те или иные проблемы всегда будут.","en":"There will always be some kind of problem.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"or"},null,{"g":"problem","l":"проблема"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"}]},{"text":"Я предлагаю иной подход.","en":"I suggest a different approach.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"approach"}]},{"text":"На иные вопросы тяжело ответить.","en":"Some questions are hard to answer.","words":[{"g":"on / at"},null,{"g":"question","l":"вопрос"},{"g":"heavily, heftily"},{"g":"to answer, to reply"}]},{"text":"Можешь ли ты предоставить мне иной выбор?","en":"Can you give me another alternative?","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"whether (question)"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to let have , to leave"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"choice"}]}]}